l the tools used for creating the campaign are included with the release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309720/extras/2a2e62de338fa7b1edff6c41559d52f2.poster.avif?t=1745273135\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309720/extras/2a2e62de338fa7b1edff6c41559d52f2.webm?t=1745273135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309720/extras/2a2e62de338fa7b1edff6c41559d52f2.mp4?t=1745273135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
